# Keral Keep Disciples: "Whenever you activate a loyalty ability of a Chandra planeswalker, this creature deals 1 damage to each
# opponent." On turn 2 Bot2 activates his own Chandra, Torch of Defiance's "+1: Add {R}{R}": a Chandra's loyalty ability, but not
# Bot1's activation, so nobody is hurt. On turn 3 Bot1 does the same with his Chandra: that +1 adds mana, yet it is a loyalty
# ability and so no mana ability (CR 605.1a) - it uses the stack, the trigger goes above it (Stack.Count = 2) and resolves first
# (the ruling: Bot2 at 19 while the +1 waits). On turn 5 Bot1 activates Ajani Resolute's 0, a loyalty ability of a planeswalker
# that isn't a Chandra: nothing (Bot2 stays at 19).

